6: /// <summary>
7: /// Tests the server connection that the SQL Server integration test classes use by default: LocalDB with integrated
8: /// security, a trusted server certificate, no database, and a 120 s connect timeout, so a LocalDB instance that is
9: /// still starting when several SQL Server test classes open it at once does not fail the Windows integration lane.
10: /// </summary>
